  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/12/IMG_9963.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>270 fotos del Bel&eacute;n de la Caja Rural de Onda, que han visitado algunos colegios (68 fotos), de la entrega de premios del concurso, que han ganado Miguel y Ana Ruiz Fr&iacute;as (76 fotos) entre los 34 que se han presentado a esta XXX edici&oacute;n (126 fotos).</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/12/IMG_9982.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Tambi&eacute;n im&aacute;genes de la inauguraci&oacute;n oficial del Bel&eacute;n, y de la exposici&oacute;n de bodegones y paisages de los fondos propios de la entidad.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pessebrecaixaruralonda16/p1450234.jpg\" alt=\"p1450234\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pessebrecaixaruralonda16/p1450235.jpg\" alt=\"p1450235\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pessebrecaixaruralonda16/p1450237.jpg\" alt=\"p1450237\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pessebrecaixaruralonda16/p1450238.jpg\" alt=\"p1450238\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pessebrecaixaruralonda16/p1450239.jpg\" alt=\"p1450239\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pessebrecaixaruralonda16/p1450240.jpg\" alt=\"p1450240\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pessebrecaixaruralonda16/p1450241.jpg\" alt=\"p1450241\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd